% Text built-ins. Everything counts code points; positions are 1-based and 0
% means "not found".

### name: txt.len
--- source
LEN("Zażółć")
--- expect
num 6
===
### name: txt.len.astral
--- note
Two code points, four UTF-8 bytes, three UTF-16 units. LEN counts code points.
--- source
LEN("👍a")
--- expect
num 2
===
### name: txt.left
--- source
LEFT("Zażółć", 3)
--- expect
text "Zaż"
===
### name: txt.left.astral
--- source
LEFT("👍ab", 1)
--- expect
text "👍"
===
### name: txt.left.beyond-end
--- source
LEFT("ab", 9)
--- expect
text "ab"
===
### name: txt.right
--- source
RIGHT("👍ab", 2)
--- expect
text "ab"
===
